Begin by chopping the @broccoli crowns{2} and @kale{}(chopped) into bite size pieces.

Use a #spiralizer{} to spiralize the @zucchini{3} and add to a #large bowl{} with the kale and broccoli. Dice the @avocados{2} and add as well(it's okay to mash them up a bit, because it makes it creamier). Add the @peas{1%cup} and @hemp seeds{3%tbsp}.

Juice the @lemons{2} and add the @basil{1%bunch}(chopped). Mix well.

Top with @sauerkraut{} and enjoy!